From 263e7e24406ae80d7e26ee46e6c9e4e0466337a0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tony Germaneri <tonygermaneri@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 16:16:02 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Build before testing so jest never runs against a stale dist

The spec requires ../../dist/index.js, but nothing rebuilt it before jest ran
locally; CI happened to build first. An npm pretest hook makes the local
command match CI.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TfaonRphAE5yYSrXUeJqbJ
---
 package.json | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/package.json b/package.json
index bd6716c..029efb9 100644
--- a/package.json
+++ b/package.json
@@ -15,6 +15,7 @@
     "scripts": {
         "build": "./node_modules/.bin/tsc",
         "lint": "./node_modules/.bin/tslint -p tsconfig.json",
+        "pretest": "./node_modules/.bin/tsc",
         "test": "./node_modules/.bin/jest",
         "build-docs": "./node_modules/.bin/typedoc ./src"
     },
-- 
2.50.1 (Apple Git-155)

